---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Made Out of Clay Productions — Picture Books by Isaiah Hartwell"
metaTitle: "Children's Picture Books | Made Out of Clay"
description: "Gentle, neurodiversity-affirming, and faith-filled picture books for ages 2–7 from a small family-run studio."
schemaOrg: true
schemaFaq: true
---
{% from "partials/book-card.njk" import bookCard %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Independent picture-book imprint</p>
      <h1>Stories that help kids feel seen, steady, and brave.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Gentle, neurodiversity-affirming, and faith-filled picture books for ages 2–7—created by a small family-run studio and made for reading together.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/books/#find-by-need">Find a book for your child</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg" href="https://club.madeoutofclayprod.com/reader/">Read a story free</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-proof">9 hardcovers available · 4 print series · free digital stories and printables</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="false">
      {% for heroBook in [books[0], books[3], books[7], books[6]] %}
      <picture>
        <source srcset="{{ heroBook.cover | assetVariant('avif') }}" type="image/avif">
        <source srcset="{{ heroBook.cover | assetVariant('webp') }}" type="image/webp">
        <img src="{{ heroBook.cover }}" alt="{{ heroBook.alt }}" width="200" height="200"{% if loop.first %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %} decoding="async">
      </picture>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="club-banner" aria-label="Digital Book Club">
  <div class="wrap club-banner-inner">
    <span class="club-float club-float-1" aria-hidden="true">⭐</span>
    <span class="club-float club-float-2" aria-hidden="true">📚</span>
    <span class="club-float club-float-3" aria-hidden="true">🖍️</span>
    <div class="club-copy">
      <span class="club-kicker">✨ Free digital library</span>
      <h2>Step inside the Book&nbsp;Club</h2>
      <p>Read free digital stories in self-read mode—including the digital-only <em>Brave Like Me</em> collection—explore the Clubhouse, and download printables. Narration is coming soon.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn-club" href="https://club.madeoutofclayprod.com/">
      <span class="btn-club-emoji" aria-hidden="true">📖</span>
      <span class="btn-club-text">Open the Book&nbsp;Club</span>
      <span class="btn-club-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/trust.njk" %}

<section class="section" id="series">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">What does your reader need today?</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Four print series, each with a clear place to begin.</p>
    <div class="series-grid">
      {% for s in series %}
      <div class="series-card" style="--accent: {{ s.accent }}; --accent-soft: {{ s.accentSoft }}; --accent-text: {{ s.accentText or s.accent }};">
        <p class="need-label">{% if s.slug == 'sunnys-table' %}Big feelings and calm{% elif s.slug == 'just-the-way-you-are' %}Neurodiversity and belonging{% elif s.slug == 'titus-the-lamb' %}Faith and Bible stories{% else %}Courage and adventure{% endif %}</p>
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p class="series-tag">{{ s.tagline }}</p>
        <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
        <a class="series-link" href="/series/{{ s.slug }}/">Explore {{ s.name }} &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section origin-story">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why Made Out of Clay exists</p>
    <h2>A father, his son, and the stories he could not find.</h2>
    <p>The studio began with a father creating affirming stories inspired by his autistic son—stories where different ways of sensing, communicating, and belonging are part of a whole child, never a deficit to repair.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/blog/why-it-is-called-made-out-of-clay/">Read the founding story</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Start with these stories</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Six reader favorites and useful starting points. Browse the full catalog for every title.</p>
    <p class="purchase-disclosure"><strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> Buy on Amazon buttons are affiliate links. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Details.</a></p>
    <div class="book-grid">
      {% for book in books %}{% if loop.index <= 6 %}
        {{ bookCard(book, site, lookups.seriesBySlug[book.series].name) }}
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="section-action"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/books/">Browse all ten print titles</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/reviews.njk" %}

{% include "partials/faq.njk" %}

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
    <h2>New books &amp; free printables</h2>
    <p>Join the family list for new releases, coloring pages, and gentle reads for the kids you love.</p>
    {% set signupLocation = "homepage" %}
    {% include "partials/newsletter.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
